 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I'm practicing what I would say if I ever saw my family again. I haven't told anyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Aceng has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Done — their story has a crack in it now."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "There — the story splits again. You mark the spot."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You say nothing. The silence sits at the fire with everyone else."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Okay — I need to move. But I'm glad we talked.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"You're a good listener, you know that?\" A tired smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? Before the scattering, I stole from someone who trusted me. I think about it every day.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"Help me haul something back? Too much for one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Halfway to the cache spot, Hannah freezes. Fresh tracks — big. \"We go back now. Quietly.\" You do. The wild, reminding you."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"a burned farmhouse — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"a ridge with a view for miles — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The moot is called. The fire gets built up."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Counted."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "The ground remembers."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "Names, named."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "You watch who eats with whom, who laughs a little too loud at whose jokes. Nothing solid. Keep looking."
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "\"That's enough for now. It'll percolate.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about their secret — we left it mid-thought, 4 days back. 'They fill the quiet. Anyway — where was I?'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You walk to the tree line with Hannah. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Still on their secret.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "A warmth settles over the conversation — they lean in a little."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Caleb always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I count portions out loud before eating. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"We're done for now. Not done-done. For now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Hah. Did you leave someone behind? ...Sorry. You don't have to answer that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "Just: \"Yeah.\" A long quiet. \"Me too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I don't talk about that. Not because it's secret — because saying it out loud makes it real in a way I can't afford yet. Someday. Not today.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Still on who you left behind.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up? It'll pass.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Caleb is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Caleb said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "You show them White Oak Acorns — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 17,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Can we talk?\" Chloe glances around first. \"People are saying things. About you. Is any of it true?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Do you still sing? ...Sorry — weird question. I just realized I haven't heard anyone sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Ha! The creek concerts. I've heard those. Keep going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Well. Still on whether you still sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want? Ha.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"The Pit. They just... took Nora. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You show them Goldenrod — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about their secret — we wandered off it, 7 days back. '...Anyway. What did you want to ask?'.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"As I said — Still on their secret.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind? I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took Nora — The Pit, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Go. But sit with what I said.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 24,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Pantry's thin and getting thinner. Will you forage with me tomorrow? Two pairs of eyes, twice the ground.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Meet me at where the biriba grows thick and we'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Who Ate It?. They just... took Nora and Hannah. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"We're eating through stores faster than we replace them. Forage with me tomorrow? I know the ridge above the creek.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. Nobody's worked the ridge above the creek in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "There is no playable joint foraging outing yet. Giving food does not perform the promised outing."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"This one — Autumn Crocus. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"You saw it too, right? Who Ate It?. Tell me I didn't imagine the lights.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 40,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  }
 ],
