  "echoSay": 0,
  "echoSample": [
   "d17: \"Caleb always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\"",
   "d17: \"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Caleb is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\"",
   "d17: \"I keep turning over the last thing Caleb said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  ],
